Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, you just never know what \Nlife has in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:14.71,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Indeed. Permission to meet him \Nalone was a surprise to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:15.98,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,but if things go well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:18.74,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,His Majesty will consider the \Nrequest for a magic tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Impressive power of collusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.09,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That's not what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:28.27,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Apparently, the Royal Sorcerers \Ntook an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.89,0:00:31.38,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,What kind of magic did you learn recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:41.64,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Wow! A cat. It's a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:45.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Initially it was transparent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:48.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but now I can even do white or calico.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:50.60,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Is this really water?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:54.74,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Magic sure is a wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Some motions are still unnatural,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:01.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I want to study more and am \Nhoping to reproduce their meows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:04.50,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Oh, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You like cats that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:07.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Why not keep a real cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:10.98,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.61,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,If something like this was at home,\N I'd never get any work done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:17.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you leverage the wealth \Nand power of the Gurions,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:21.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can collect cute \Ncats from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:24.14,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,We will not keep any\Nanimals in our household.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:27.81,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,We can't have them running around \Nyour feet and making you trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:30.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But you needn't worry about me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:33.17,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,And Tina prefers dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:34.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:38.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You are thinking of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:40.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:42.07,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,No need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.53,0:01:44.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then how about keeping cats outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:51.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko told me that keeping cats outside is\Na sign of a certain status among nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:53.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and apparently bringing them \Ninside is considered crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.51,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,Did she really mean cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.59,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,Coming from that maid, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:01.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Her Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:02.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:05.93,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,Then maybe it's really about cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:06.60,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:10.35,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Keeping cats outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:13.46,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Hmm, may not be a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:53.14,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,OFF TO THE CASTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:51.50,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Hello, Lord Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:53.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Oh, Lady Raysha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:58.00,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to greet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:04.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm honored to meet you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:06.97,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Lady Raysha is the second princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.68,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,so greet her properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:12.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, then you're my future sister-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:14.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:16.22,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:18.08,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'm Raysha Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:21.13,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Mirika has told me so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.85,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,By the way, you brought a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:25.98,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,How adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.41,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Ah, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:36.20,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:39.87,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I didn't even name him...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:41.38,main - italics,RAYSHA/I,0,0,0,,He's more skilled than I'd heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:44.09,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,How fleeting it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.71,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Then I shall take Kunon \Nto the Black Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:51.52,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.50,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I will have an audience with His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.02,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,How will you get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can get home by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like to see Her Highness, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.55,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:04.03,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'll arrange a carriage for you,\N so enjoy your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:04.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I actually reserved an \Nauspicious restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,the one where Father managed\Nto win Mother over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.44,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That's quite enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.49,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Go and have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:13.83,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:17.33,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,The Black Tower is on the \Nother side of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.29,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Are you comfortable walking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:21.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.34,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Then listen while we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,About the essence of sorcerers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.97,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Not quite, since I'm still new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A new interpretation of \Ncompound magic, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:34.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, the way to apply the old \Ninterpretation to the new one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be the new theory on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:37.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,three-dimensional and \Noblique magic circles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.35,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:42.53,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I can't have such high-level \Nconversations while walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:43.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:46.22,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I trust you've heard from Mirika
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:51.09,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,that there are seven princes \Nand ten princesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:53.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The higher ratio of girls is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:58.83,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,The throne goes to the first \Nprince in most countries,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:01.75,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,but in Hughlia we lean toward meritocracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:05.59,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,So, depending on achievement,\Nbirth order can be overturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've heard that it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.18,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:13.47,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I, however, relinquished my right \Nto the throne to be a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I sense so many magical powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.94,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,What kind of sorcerers are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:25.64,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Mirika is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:29.49,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,concerned that you might get dragged\Ninto the issue of royal succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:30.74,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:33.37,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,What's that?! What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:38.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I created a very thin layer of \Nwater on my shoes and froze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.75,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Froze a very thin layer of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's like an ice sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's faster than walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:46.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would you like to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:47.74,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:51.64,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Hold on! I must tell you \Nbefore we do anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you put your weight on it, \Nit creates friction and—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:56.27,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.79,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Don't affiliate with a faction carelessly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:01.65,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,and don't sign or say anything\Nthat can be used against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:02.91,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.77,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Now, let me skate, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:09.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Very well. I'd like to skate \Nwith a beautiful lady like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:11.65,main,MAID,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:12.87,main,MAID,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.35,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:18.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The trick is to float just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:22.00,main,CIVIL SERVANT,0,0,0,,Wh-What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.88,main,SOLDIER 1,0,0,0,,Please stop, Lady Raysha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.59,main,SOLDIER 2,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.54,main,SOLDIER 2,0,0,0,,N-No good. They're too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.14,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.72,main,SOLDIER 1; 2,0,0,0,,Sir Dario!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.65,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.73,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Stop at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,He's telling us to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:48.36,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.87,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Go faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.47,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Stop... right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.68,main,KUNON/RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.75,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,What's the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.81,main,SERVANT,0,0,0,,A child sorcerer made mischief \Nand got caught by a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.88,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Welcome, Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:18.78,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I'm Londimonde Achthard, the Grand \NMaster of the Royal Sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:23.89,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:28.02,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I thought Lady Raysha's \Nmagic was impressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.91,0:08:30.77,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,but his is on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:36.11,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I hear you have a water crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, on my left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.84,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,A two-star, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:45.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A two-star?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:58.68,main - top,SIGN {left to right},0,0,0,,FIRE, WATER, EARTH, WIND,\NLIGHT, DARKNESS, FOUL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:48.27,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,There are seven types of \Ncrests borne by sorcerers:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:55.17,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,fire, water, earth, wind, \Nlight, darkness, and foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.29,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Each crest has five ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:04.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Five... Then I assume mine is water, \Nsecond from the bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:08.19,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Yes. Statistically, two-stars \Nare the most common.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.44,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'm also a two-star, of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:11.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But you're not, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.71,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:18.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The density of your magical \Npower is completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:21.04,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,An interesting description.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:25.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right. If the magical powers of Lady \NRaysha and I are regular cheese,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,yours is like premium blue cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.60,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,That sounds stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.80,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Not that I mind, \Nsince it goes well with wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:34.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grand Master Blue Cheese \Nis a three-star, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.09,0:09:38.43,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I'll be mad if you call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.25,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I am... this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A four-star.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.74,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,You're not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:49.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is my first time hearing about\Ncrests, so it's not really sinking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:51.57,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Right. You'll get it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:54.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grand Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:55.59,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:10:00.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Does the difference in ranks \Ninfluence the magic one can wield?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:03.08,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,There's no clear categorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.96,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,The only clear distinction we know of \Nis the total amount of magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:11.92,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,What matters is what you'll learn \Nfrom now and how devoted you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.63,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Well, then, can we move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:19.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.18,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Then let the fun time begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.47,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I am fascinated by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:32.69,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Let me give you a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:35.40,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,He's amazing! Already amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.24,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,That's not fair. You've already seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.14,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Seen it? I've experienced it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.07,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Oh, I am very jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.41,main,ROYAL SORCERER 1,0,0,0,,Wait, is that the Hero's \NScar by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.50,main,ROYAL SORCERER 2,0,0,0,,He's still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.16,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,He gave none other than \NSir Dario a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:51.97,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,I'm interested to see what \Nkind of magic he uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:58.61,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Does this mean a Royal Sorcerer can\Ncome be my teacher if I pass the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.09,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Victo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:03.78,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.47,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.11,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Now, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.67,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Can you conquer these with your A-ori?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.73,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Conquer magic with magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:33.54,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.80,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:42.26,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,This is magic to produce and \Nmanipulate water. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.87,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:52.39,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It can also control water \Nthat's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:55.26,main - flashback,KUNON (7YRS)/I,0,0,0,,{\i1}Control water that's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.28,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I've controlled water many times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:03.49,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,But manipulating the water \Nanother sorcerer created...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.53,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:10.32,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,He nonchalantly gave me an \Nassignment neither Miss Jenié
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:12.87,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,nor I could come up with!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:17.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:31.16,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I've never experienced water that resists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.65,0:12:43.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:47.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:53.54,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.85,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Only two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.83,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,So this is a Royal Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:14.34,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.31,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,You're very good, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:21.29,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,I didn't expect him to \Ntake any, Grand Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:23.82,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,May I have this child?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.21,main,ROYAL SORCERER 1,0,0,0,,What? Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:26.45,main,ROYAL SORCERER 2,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.74,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Didn't you just get dumped \Nby your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.60,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:31.33,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:34.02,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,You can't even look after yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.73,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:39.83,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Everyone seems to want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:43.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Does that mean I passed the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.59,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:48.02,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Why don't we try a few more things?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:51.39,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I'd love to experience your magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:02.61,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:07.17,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,And this is the Grand Master of the \NRoyal Sorcerers with a four-star crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.65,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Let us try it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.17,main,ROYAL SORCERER 1,0,0,0,,Please switch with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:13.74,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,That's right! Hurry and \Nlet us do it, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:18.37,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm looking at \Nsomething I'm not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:20.09,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.38,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,What's this? What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:25.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's Supersoft-Body A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:30.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I encased water in a super soft \Nand super stretchy membrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:34.25,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Imagine how well you'll sleep \Nif you make a bed out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.02,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,It might help absorb the shock of a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:41.77,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I haven't had this much fun \Nwith a magic test in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:45.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If I increase the elasticity, \Nyou can jump so high
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:48.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,that you can easily reach the \Nsecond floor of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.04,main,ROYAL SORCERERS,0,0,0,,Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.51,main,ROYAL SORCERERS,0,0,0,,I'd love to try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:54.22,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,No, you shouldn't, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:58.00,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Show us any more magic, and you \Nwon't be able to go home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.46,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want to let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:04.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I have dinner with my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.42,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:11.28,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Kunon, you can make other \Nanimals than cats, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.86,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Can you make humans as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:16.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I can. A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.14,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,A water doll, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:31.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. But just like animals, their \Nmovements are still imperfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:34.35,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Does that mean, if your magic allows,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:39.48,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,it's possible to have humanlike motion\Nor make it move in ways humans can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I tried letting it fly \Nas an experiment, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:52.54,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,It's not very pleasant to watch, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It wasn't well received.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.02,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'd like to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.47,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Yes! Please show us, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:00.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:19.21,main,MAID,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:21.06,main,PEOPLE,0,0,0,,I-Is that a person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.51,main,PEOPLE,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.10,main,KUNON/ROYAL SORCERERS,0,0,0,,We're very sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:35.34,main,ROYAL SORCERER 2,0,0,0,,It was Victo who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.26,main,ROYAL SORCERER 2,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.31,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,That's why you got dumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:39.68,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.91,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,But you were all excited about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:45.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I got scolded twice today alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:49.40,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Feeling down isn't going \Nto change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:54.15,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Next time, why don't we \Ndiscuss magic over lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:57.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next time? Does that mean I passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:01.21,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,You saw how much fun I had,\N so no need to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:06.17,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,I'll personally take care of assigning \Na sorcerer to be your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:11.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:15.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Will this imply I support a \Nspecific royal faction?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.05,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,No, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:20.52,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Power and status mean \Nnothing to Royal Sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:27.94,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,For my information, I'd like to \Nask if you have a future goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:32.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My goal is to create eyeballs with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:35.82,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:37.62,main,ROYAL SORCERER 3,0,0,0,,How intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.58,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,That's nice. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:53.90,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I've heard about my son's \Nbad reputation twice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.38,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.63,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Kunon is not to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:03.60,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We all got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:06.14,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I must disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.69,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Regardless of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:11.36,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,those who use magic should always be \Nheld accountable for their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.97,0:18:14.66,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Hurting someone because \Nthey're told to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:17.51,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Killing people because \Nthey're ordered to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:20.49,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Things like that should never be allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.66,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Magic is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:28.62,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,No matter who commands you, \Nrefuse if it can bring harm to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:32.46,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,As long as you wield power, \Nyou are responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:39.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I am very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:50.18,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,But I'm surprised he stayed \Nthis late in that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:53.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:19:00.74,main - italics,ARSAN/I,0,0,0,,It seems you're in their \Ngood books, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:05.61,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Kunon, don't you have to go get Mirika?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:07.33,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Don't you have dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Is it that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:11.62,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Yes, it's starting to get dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:13.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:16.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It'd be so ungentlemanly of \Nme to greet Her Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:18.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,all sweaty and out of breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.64,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,True, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:23.14,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Let's combine our magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:24.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.39,0:19:26.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.47,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:38.13,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I told you I had a wind crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:42.66,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,If we fly this with my wind, \Nwe can get to Mirika's in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:45.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,An interesting experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:48.16,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:50.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I promised myself that\Nthe first time I fly or float
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,alone with someone, \Nit'd be with Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:57.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I'm sure your fiancé \Ncould misunderstand as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:20:00.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,He'll blame you for \Nflying alone with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:02.43,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:04.06,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Come on, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.68,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I don't have a fiancé!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.17,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Let it float.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:12.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:21.08,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Ready to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Isn't it too fast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:36.05,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,So far, so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:37.46,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Let's go even faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.58,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We're here, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:47.65,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We made i—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:52.87,main,KUNON/RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:59.31,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'm grateful this is soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:01.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am grateful this is soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:05.86,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I should have gradually \Ndecreased speed and altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:08.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But now we know it can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.37,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We need to experiment more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:17.75,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You've done something dangerous again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:21.07,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,This is your third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:24.44,main,KUNON/RAYSHA,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:30.21,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Do you think Kunon will like this color?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:32.59,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,It's Your Highness's favorite color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.59,0:21:34.52,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:37.02,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:40.61,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,To make Her Highness head \Nover heels like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:44.50,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,What kind of a gentleman is Kunon Gurion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:47.66,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,First of all, Lady Raysha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:51.22,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,I must say that you lack awareness that \Nyou are a part of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:53.47,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,You should be the one to respect rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {top left},0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE:\NQUITE A BOY AND A NEW MASTER
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.82,0:23:39.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Quite a \NBoy and a New Master."
